    "updated_at": "2016-11-30T12:00:17Z",
    "body": "What is the reason they can't be made? So that silicon valley companies can charge consulting fees to \"secure\" web applications?\r\n\r\nSeriously it makes no sense whatsoever to keep an insecure specification insecure.",
